<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer matches played</p>
<p>in the German league championship on Saturday:</p>
<p> Arminia Bielefeld	    2   Borussia Dortmund    0</p>
<p> Karlsruhe			3   Hamburg		  1</p>
<p> Borussia Moenchengladbach  0   VfB Stuttgart	  1</p>
<p> Bochum			   3   Freiburg		 2</p>
<p> Bayern Munich		  5   Fortuna Duesseldorf  0</p>
<p> Schalke			  1   Cologne		  1</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p> Duisburg			 2   1860 Munich	    3</p>
<p> Bayer Leverkusen	     2   Werder Bremen	  1</p>
<p>Played on Thursday:</p>
<p> St Pauli			 0   Hansa Rostock	  1</p>
</text>
